            creation. No ResizeObserver is attached to the scroll container.".to_string();
        b008.fix_applied = "Added ResizeObserver on scrollEl after PTY creation. \
            On resize: cols = Math.floor(scrollEl.offsetWidth / 7.22), rows = Math.floor(scrollEl.offsetHeight / 18). \
